  "description": "Unemployed, unemployed, cyberstalking in the corner of the house, leaving malicious comments, Chae Seo-Geum. He ends up meeting the artist Kim Tae-In who he was obsessed with, at the police station after he sues him. He is nervous for a moment because it is his first time visiting the police station, but his heart flutters when he sees Tae-In's face. In the end, Seo-Geum crosses the line with Tae-In again as he leaves the police station as soon as he finishes his investigation..!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
